[{:adr/id "2607125100"
  :adr/title "cloud-itonami-isic-5820 gains a real-model adapter for RevOps-LLM (wired, pending credentials)"
  :adr/status :accepted
  :adr/date "2026-07-12"
  :db/id -1
  :adr/related ["2607124600-cloud-itonami-isic-5820-http-service-layer" "orgs/gftdcojp/cloud-itonami cloud_itonami.runtime ITO_MODEL_* precedent"]
  :adr/loop-context "Sixth cycle of the /loop dynamic-mode self-paced 'raise maturity toward live production operation' task. De-risks blocker #2 (no real LLM connection) from the owner's outstanding-questions list without requiring credentials that don't exist in this sandbox."
  :adr/decision "Added src/crm/llm_realmodel.clj: real-model adapter wrapping crm.llm.cljc's existing generic llm-advisor (no change to the OperationActor graph's advisor contract). Env vars ISIC5820_MODEL_PROVIDER/_URL/_MODEL/_API_KEY (ISIC-prefixed variant of this org's own established ITO_MODEL_* convention from orgs/gftdcojp/cloud-itonami's cloud_itonami.runtime). ISIC5820_MODEL_API_KEY is the sole trigger for switching from the sealed mock to the real adapter. Delegates actual request/response wire logic to langchain.model's existing generic openai-model/anthropic-model, not reimplemented."
  :adr/verification-boundary "Explicitly and honestly scoped: (a) preflight's full missing/present matrix fully verified, no credentials needed; (b) the adapter's HTTP request/response wire shape verified via a REAL local http-kit stub server round-trip (genuine socket, not an in-process fake); (c) whether any real target model API (OpenAI/Anthropic/an actual gateway) accepts this exact request shape is COMPLETELY UNVERIFIED -- no credentials exist in this sandbox and none were fabricated. This line is deliberately not blurred."
  :adr/test-status "63 tests / 200 assertions (up from 50/175 pre-existing), 0 failures, lint 0 errors/0 warnings, commit f3c5facfc1e027c8038d4d564d3cc4861329e79c, pushed. Regression confirmed: sealed mock remains default when ISIC5820_MODEL_API_KEY unset."
  :adr/remaining-gaps "Real end-to-end model connectivity remains unverified pending owner-supplied credentials; cloud-itonami-isic-6201 lacks an equivalent adapter; cloud-itonami-isic-6202 (showing very recent commit activity from its owning session) was not touched, consistent with the standing decision to avoid it without coordination."
  :adr/scope-note "New ADR documenting a cross-cutting infrastructure de-risking step distinct from the HTTP/persistence/auth work in prior cycles of the same loop"}]
